    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000ucly](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000ucly) Magnitude 5.9 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Nov 21 2026 82km W of Delingha. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 37.1958 longitude 96.6398. It impacted 1815 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
